// A question (tickets-patterns story.tex, A question, escalated): an agent asks, the lead answers, dismisses it with
// a reason, or passes it up to the owner with why. The asker opened it, so it is told once, when it closes, with the
// answer. Who answers is policy's (fills for role lead). A project with no lead running (a new one, its first agent
// asking) passes it up to the owner, saying so: no `NoWorker` stop (the owner, paper-research N-1978 p2).
/// an agent's question: the lead answers it, dismisses it, or passes it up to the owner
kind question
  form ask: Text, context: Text?
  result Answered(text: Text) | Dismissed(why: Text)
  pattern
    a <- try { step role lead answer(ask, context) } handle {
      NoWorker(w) => return Up("no lead is running in this project")
    };
    match a {
      Answer(text) => return Answered(text)
      Dismiss(why) => return Dismissed(why)
      Up(why) =>
        o <- step owner reply(ask, context, why);
        match o {
          Answer(text) => return Answered(text)
          Dismiss(why) => return Dismissed(why)
        }
    }
